#==============================================================================================
#
#   calculated_style_value_9 - CalculatedStyleValue: simplifying a calculation tree
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/CalculatedStyleValue.cpp (lines 3213-3741):
#       find_numeric_child_with_same_unit, make_calculation_node and "simplify a calculation
#       tree" (css-values-4), split into one function per step that needs more than a few lines:
#       resolving a numeric leaf, the partial simplification of min()/max(), Negate, Invert, Sum
#       and Product nodes. Each step function is the donor's step body; the root function
#       keeps the donor's order of steps.
